  "description": "Dive into the world of monster cuisine!\nYou take on the role of an adorable monster chef on a unique culinary journey. With a food truck as your mobile base, travel through diverse locations from deserts to big cities serving up meals to monstrous customers.\n\n\nWatch out, you might end up as the meal!\nGet ready for a thrilling culinary experience where time is your biggest enemy! With impatient customers waiting, be quick or you might end up on the menu.\n\n\nPlay solo or in local coop!\nWork as a team to serve your demanding customers as quickly as possible! Play in local, but don’t take too long… or you might end up as the ingredient!\n\nHunt animals to use in your recipes!\nPrepare meals that defy conventional standards, using exotic creatures from each location. Hunt rats on the street, pigeons in the square, or cockroaches in the sewers!\n\n\nDifferent cooking methods and combinations!\nWith skill and precision, slice, fry, roast, and cook these bizarre ingredients in your mobile kitchen, equipped with various utensils and equipment.\n\n\nUpgrade your Food Truck!\nAs you progress through the levels, your food truck evolves, unlocking new equipment for increasingly difficult challenges. There are 20 levels across 4 distinct locations, each with its own immersive atmosphere and customizable vehicle.\n\n\nSurvive the madness !\nFace increasingly difficult days in the new Survival Mode, fully playable solo or with up to 2 chefs in local. Upgrade your truck, handle the mounting pressure, and try to reach retirement together!",
